<title>HUNGARY: SOCCER-FERENCVAROS DEFEAT OLYMPIAKOS 3-1 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FERENCVAROS DEFEAT OLYMPIAKOS 3-1 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ferencvaros of Hungary beat Olympiakos Pireus of Greece 3-1 (2-1) in the UEFA Cup first round, first leg played on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ferencvaros: Gabor Zavadszky (11th); Mirza Varesanovic</p>
<p>(o.g. 35th); Laszlo Arany (52nd)</p>
<p>Olimpiakos Pireus:</p>
<p>Ilija Ivic (30th)</p>
<p>Attendance:7,000</p>
</text>
